  m_Name: Job_Terrace
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: WoodcraftSimulator::WoodcraftSimulator.Jobs.JobDefinition
  id: terrace-job
  displayName: Small terrace
  description: "A ground-level terrace 2.4 \xD7 1.8 m in front of the workshop: pier
    blocks, beams, joists, larch decking."
  blueprint: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 64e13811f4ef96045ab2011b4e7092de, type: 2}
  stockSpecies: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fd4be3a08bd3c74f9b6fafeb4fe74ab, type: 2}
  stockLengthMillimeters: 2400
  stockWidthMillimeters: 145
  stockThicknessMillimeters: 28
  spareBoards: 0
  tips:
  - Outside, in front of the door. Set out the site at the corner stake, then dig
    and gravel each pier spot.
  - 'Build bottom up: pier blocks, beams, joists (cut 1800 mm on the sawhorses outside),
    deck boards.'
  - Beams and joists are fixed with steel connectors (drill-driver); deck screws
    at the board ends need pilot holes.
  - The customer paid half as a deposit for the material; the rest comes on delivery.
  payEuros: 650
  requiresFinish: 0
  extraStocks:
  - species: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dca24a1dc39899146a557f009cce814a, type: 2}
    lengthMillimeters: 2400
    widthMillimeters: 145
