  depositShare: 0.5
  displayNameTurkish: "K\xFC\xE7\xFCk teras"
  descriptionTurkish: "At\xF6lyenin \xF6n\xFCnde zemine yak\u0131n 2,4 \xD7 1,8 m
    teras: beton ayaklar, kiri\u015Fler, d\xF6\u015Feme alt\u0131 kiri\u015Fleri,
    melez d\xF6\u015Feme."
  tipsTurkish:
  - "D\u0131\u015Far\u0131da, kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde. K\xF6\u015Fe kaz\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    alan\u0131 i\u015Faretle, sonra her ayak yerini kaz ve \xE7ak\u0131l d\xF6k."
  - "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131dan yukar\u0131 kur: beton ayaklar, kiri\u015Fler, d\xF6\u015Feme
    alt\u0131 kiri\u015Fleri (d\u0131\u015Far\u0131daki sehpalarda 1800 mm kes),
    d\xF6\u015Feme tahtalar\u0131."
  - "Kiri\u015Fler ve d\xF6\u015Feme alt\u0131 kiri\u015Fleri \xE7elik ba\u011Flant\u0131
    elemanlar\u0131yla sabitlenir (\u015Farjl\u0131 matkap); tahta u\xE7lar\u0131ndaki
    vidalar pilot delik ister."
  - "M\xFC\u015Fteri malzeme i\xE7in yar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 avans olarak \xF6dedi;
    kalan\u0131 teslimde gelir."
